7", "id": 4273795292, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-vPDc", "user": {"login": "MeaingCheung", "id": 17570116, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTcwMTE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17570116?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung", "html_url": "https://github.com/MeaingCheung", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MeaingCheung/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T13:40:21Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T13:40:21Z", "body": "Same issue +1", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4273795292/reactions", "total_count": 3, "+1": 3, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4273860020", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127#issuecomment-4273860020", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127", "id": 4273860020, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-ve20", "user": {"login": "hsntommy2001", "id": 50758893, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzU4ODkz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50758893?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001", "html_url": "https://github.com/hsntommy2001", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hsntommy2001/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T14:12:09Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T14:18:56Z", "body": "Same here, API key checked it fine using \n\ncurl \"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3-flash-preview:generateContent?key={MY_API-KEY}\" \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Hello\"}]}]}'\n\nAlready re-install Ubuntu (clear everything T.T), the issue remains\n\nIt seems that the API key inside .env was not loaded when running hermes agent", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4273860020/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4273893223", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127#issuecomment-4273893223", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127", "id": 4273893223, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-vm9n", "user": {"login": "ciiiii", "id": 28784251, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg0MjUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28784251?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii", "html_url": "https://github.com/ciiiii", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ciiiii/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T14:27:11Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T14:27:11Z", "body": "Confirming this affects **legacy `AIza`-prefix keys** on `v2026.4.16` (0.10.0). Downgrading to `v2026.4.13` (0.9.0) fixes it.\n\nIntercepted what hermes v0.10.0 sends to `generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai`:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer not-used\nx-goog-api-key: AIzaSy\u2026<real key>\n```\n\nTested the same key with `curl`, varying only headers:\n\n| Headers | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `Authorization: Bearer <AIza-key>` only | **200** |\n| `x-goog-api-key: <AIza-key>` only | 400 `Missing or invalid Authorization header` |\n| `Authorization: Bearer not-used` + `x-goog-api-key: <AIza-key>` | 400 `API key not valid` |\n\nGoogle requires `Authorization: Bearer` for AIza keys. #11961's domain-wide suppression of Bearer breaks them. Likely needs to branch on key prefix (`AIza*` \u2192 Bearer; `AQ.*` \u2192 x-goog-api-key).\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4273893223/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4274322212", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127#issuecomment-4274322212", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127", "id": 4274322212, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-xPsk", "user": {"login": "alizane", "id": 155546898, "node_id": "U_kgDOCUV1Eg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155546898?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane", "html_url": "https://github.com/alizane", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alizane/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T18:30:05Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T18:30:05Z", "body": "I've submitted a PR (#12204 ) that addresses this. It conditionally bypasses the x-goog-api-key header injection when the /openai endpoint is detected. This allows the standard Bearer token to handle the request properly, which resolves the header conflict identified by @ciiiii  and was confirmed to work in @prasadus92's local tests.\n\nHopefully, the maintainers can merge this soon so we don't have to keep downgrading!", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4274322212/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4274453167", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127#issuecomment-4274453167", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12127", "id": 4274453167, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-xvqv", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T19:52:29Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T19:52:29Z", "body": "Fixed by PR #12251 (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/12251), merged as ca32a2a6 on main.\n\nRoot cause: #11961 added a Google-specific header hack (`x-goog-api-key` + `api_key=\"not-used\"` to suppress Bearer) to work around an auth issue on `AQ.`-prefix keys. Google has since tightened the `/v1beta/openai` endpoint \u2014 sending both headers now returns `API key not valid` even for legacy `AIza\u2026` keys. Your curl header matrix in the comments was the empirical proof; thanks for digging in.\n\nThe fix reverts to plain Bearer auth, which Google's OpenAI-compat endpoint accepts for `AIza\u2026` keys. `AQ.`-prefix keys remain broken on this endpoint due to an upstream Google bug (https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/140545) that Google has acknowledged and said they're fixing. Workaround from Google for affected users: regenerate the key in AI Studio to get a non-`AQ` (legacy) key.\n\nCredit to @helix4u (implementation), @alizane (first triage and #12204), and @ciiiii (header matrix proof).\n\nFix will ship in the next release; `hermes update` will pick it up.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4274453167/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]